    "text": "@howhow 剛剛會議中提到【寫專利文件時的賣點分析】，可以參考這個文件\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1yTEVDecO5kyi0qBb1jIi7cUffN6j6iZz/edit?usp=drive_link&ouid=113102818136456530954&rtpof=true&sd=true",
